WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.176
- Yeah, I mean I'm just a regular

00:00:01.176 --> 00:00:03.346
guy that's never met a puppy.

00:00:03.346 --> 00:00:04.690
I don't know why people thinks that weird.

00:00:04.690 --> 00:00:09.120
(electric guitar music)

00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:11.457
- I'm here to meet some pup-pups.

00:00:11.457 --> 00:00:12.677
- I feel like I'm gonna just turn

00:00:12.677 --> 00:00:14.738
into a child when I see them.

00:00:14.738 --> 00:00:17.655
- Since I haven't had a dog I feel

00:00:17.655 --> 00:00:19.154
like something's missing in my life.

00:00:19.154 --> 00:00:22.604
- I am concerned that I may
have a puppy bite my mustache.

00:00:22.604 --> 00:00:25.772
- I'm excited to meet any puppy right now.

00:00:25.772 --> 00:00:27.881
- Come here, hey.

00:00:27.881 --> 00:00:29.515
(upbeat music)

00:00:29.515 --> 00:00:31.585
- These puppies are total divas right now.

00:00:31.585 --> 00:00:33.570
They just don't want to play with me.

00:00:33.570 --> 00:00:34.987
(laughter)

00:00:34.987 --> 00:00:36.692
- I protect them.

00:00:36.692 --> 00:00:39.622
(puppy whining)

00:00:42.351 --> 00:00:44.544
- He didn't bite my mustache.

00:00:45.808 --> 00:00:48.137
- Well, I mean, I think everything's

00:00:48.137 --> 00:00:49.687
cuter when it's a baby, right?

00:00:49.687 --> 00:00:52.848
- Whoah, this dude is so tiny.

00:00:52.848 --> 00:00:56.268
- Uh-oh, he's got a piece
of bark or something.

00:00:56.745 --> 00:00:58.071
- Want a treat?

00:01:02.236 --> 00:01:03.480
- I'm in love with this dog.

00:01:03.480 --> 00:01:05.574
- He's just so freaking cute.

00:01:05.574 --> 00:01:06.638
Oh, he's running away.

00:01:06.638 --> 00:01:08.094
- Yeah, he's gotta go.

00:01:08.094 --> 00:01:09.736
He's using it.

00:01:09.800 --> 00:01:11.488
- What's the matter?

00:01:11.610 --> 00:01:13.281
You're so excited.

00:01:13.426 --> 00:01:14.908
- How's it going?

00:01:15.045 --> 00:01:17.368
Look at you, you're so happy.

00:01:18.708 --> 00:01:19.997
- Love this dog.

00:01:19.997 --> 00:01:21.209
It's a great dog.

00:01:21.209 --> 00:01:22.701
- Is that what you want?

00:01:22.701 --> 00:01:24.448
How about you?

00:01:24.448 --> 00:01:27.264
- Ahhhhhh.

00:01:27.264 --> 00:01:29.075
I'm missing one.

00:01:30.262 --> 00:01:33.238
- Oh (laughs) Bear's got it now.

00:01:33.238 --> 00:01:34.827
- I kind of bonded with these dogs.

00:01:34.827 --> 00:01:37.180
I don't now, they're just,

00:01:37.842 --> 00:01:39.553
they're just so full of life.

00:01:39.553 --> 00:01:41.392
- It makes me want to order one right now.

00:01:41.392 --> 00:01:45.897
- It's uh, it's like
being with an old friend.

00:01:46.112 --> 00:01:49.150
- I believe a pup-pup
will choose me some day.

00:01:51.343 --> 00:01:54.990
And when the call is
made, I will answer it.

00:01:55.035 --> 00:01:59.161
- Uh, my name is uh, like Sean.

00:01:59.401 --> 00:02:00.971
Puppies are not a big deal.

00:02:00.971 --> 00:02:02.417
(fake crying)

00:02:02.417 --> 00:02:03.900
I'm so happy.

00:02:03.900 --> 00:02:06.415
I guess someone could love this, you know.

00:02:07.829 --> 00:02:09.116
Who's the baby.

00:02:09.116 --> 00:02:14.116
(making puppy yelps)

00:02:16.449 --> 00:02:17.555
- And that is all.

